  "notes": "Children who are six by 1 September enter 國民小學 that September. Twelve-year basic education is six years of 國民小學 and three of 國民中學 (compulsory), then three years of 高級中等學校 (general, vocational, comprehensive or single-subject). The curriculum guidelines number the years 一 to 十二年級; learners also say 國一–國三 and 高一–高三. The 國中教育會考 is taken at the end of 九年級. Five-year junior colleges (五專), an alternative after 九年級, are left out."
